# What never uploads with gcloud run deploy --source. The include pulls the
# whole .gitignore (env files, the key rtf, .next, node_modules); the rest is
# repo material a build does not need. Verify after edits with:
#   gcloud meta list-files-for-upload
#!include:.gitignore
.git/
.gcloudignore
tasks/
docs/
README.md
